    "4. **Interfacial Water Residence Kinetics**\n",
    "   * Implemented high-performance spatial indexing and vectorized tracking to evaluate solvent kinetics at the protein–DNA interface.\n",
    "   * Isolated long-lived structural water molecules demonstrating continuous, uninterrupted residence times of ≥ 1.0 ns (≥ 100 frames) within 3.5 Å of both TCF4 and DNA heavy atoms."
